<title>JAPAN: Enshu Truck - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Enshu Truck - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	     4.19		vs	    4.11</p>
<p> Operating	  486    million	  vs	  569    million</p>
<p> Current	    449    million	  vs	  368    million</p>
<p> Net		  248    million	  vs	  206    million</p>
<p> EPS		   37.92 yen	  vs	   37.32 yen</p>
<p> Shares		7 million	  vs	   6 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Enshu Truck Co Ltd is a trucking company.</p>
